# ThreadSanitizer suppressions (docs/DEVELOPMENT.md).
#
# Qt is not built with TSan, so TSan cannot see the mutex in Qt's posted-event queue: an event
# allocated by a worker in QMetaObject::invokeMethod(..., Qt::QueuedConnection) and deleted by
# the UI thread in sendPostedEvents is reported as a race. Our own shared state is protected by
# std::mutex and stays fully checked.
race:QCoreApplicationPrivate::sendPostedEvents
